+3. **Canonical noun+sub, alias hidden (back-compat only):** long tail (create/
+   update/comment/merge/shepherd/doc-gate/options/role/explain/stage/recap). Works
+   forever, absent from primary help — today's `ISSUE_ALIAS_COMMANDS` treatment.
 
